      "content": "but what's the point of building something new when the person who was supposed to live that life is gone? everyone i care about sees me as a mistake or a stranger now. it's like being a ghost... you can try to talk, you can try to act, but you're already dead to the world. why struggle to rebuild a life that has no place in anyone's heart anymore?",
